OL,3,GNEWSA'I dropped out of university - but
OL,4,Anow I'm teaching at one'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMid-November is one of the peak times
OL,7,Ffor young people to drop out of
OL,8,Funiversity as they struggle with the
OL,9,Fdemands of their course or living away
OL,10,Ffrom home.
OL,12,FYet you may not expect an academic to
OL,13,Fadvocate quitting - particularly one
OL,14,Fwho dropped out of a degree before
OL,15,Ffinding herself with a PhD and a job as
OL,16,Fa lecturer.
OL,18,FDr Rebecca Sharpe was the first member
OL,19,Fof her family to win a place at
OL,20,Funiversity, but within two months had
OL,21,Fleft and was working in a shopping
OL,22,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
